            "review_title": "Review at RuNam Boutique",
            "review_text": "Deralm\nBeach City, TX47 contributions\n0\nLarge piece of white chicken meat in picture is not true when you order.\nDec 2019\nMy 3rd and last visit to this restaurant. My friend and I ordered from the menu pictures a large section of white chicken meat. We received a very small portion from what the picture showed. The manager informed me the pictures are not accurate with the portions and the meat changed color form white to dark when cooking! What, does he not have any knowledge of cooking chicken, or did he deliberately lie to us. We decided to try the chicken anyway and I found a sharp bone like a toothpick in the chicken and it punctured my mouth. I then found a hair in the chicken and returned it to the kitchen. The manager decided for all of our troubles he would discount 145,000. I told him I will pay for one of the chickens my friend ate, but not the one that had a hair in it. He was so angry he took our picture for his boss. This is hilarious to think he can take advantage of the Vietnamese people like this. They lied many times to our face and called us stupid!!! Does anyone really want to go there?\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 18, 2019",
